bw-port: Antialiasing names samples per pixel (the GPU renderer multisamples, port/gpu, docs/gpu.md "Antialiasing").
sim_config.ini Antialiasing=off|4 samples; the old 2x and 4x (and BWPORT_AA, cfgscript antialias=) read as 4 samples (k = 2).
SIM_AntialiasWanted is 1 or 2. The status says when a renderer could not draw it (vcore's 8x cap); the performance test gets
gpu 3x off and 4 samples rows.

